L41_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_ACT1_PROLOGUE"
L42_1 = [[
O, great Savior. This is the end for me.
But please, save this innocent child.]]
L40_1[1] = L41_1
L40_1[2] = L42_1
L41_1 = {}
L42_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_ACT1_INTERLUDE1"
L43_1 = [[
They have a duty.
A duty to bring hope to a world full of despair.]]
L41_1[1] = L42_1
L41_1[2] = L43_1
L42_1 = {}
L43_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_1_1"
L44_1 = [[
How many sleepless nights have been caused by the pressure of the black uniform?
Even though he tired himself out, the boy could not stop.]]
L42_1[1] = L43_1
L42_1[2] = L44_1
L43_1 = {}
L44_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_ACT1_INTERLUDE2"
L45_1 = [[
The stage has been set and the actors are ready.
Now, the festival begins.]]
L43_1[1] = L44_1
L43_1[2] = L45_1
L44_1 = {}
L45_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_ACT1_INTERLUDE3"
L46_1 = [[
Her extinguished emotions were rekindled with a flame called competitiveness.
Little by little, she felt her forgotten self come back.
That was her second salvation.]]
L44_1[1] = L45_1
L44_1[2] = L46_1
L45_1 = {}
L46_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_1_2"
L47_1 = "The best companion is a reliable comrade."
L45_1[1] = L46_1
L45_1[2] = L47_1
L46_1 = {}
L47_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_1_3"
L48_1 = [[
Not sympathy, not heroism.
I just wish to stand proudly in front of those important to me.]]
L46_1[1] = L47_1
L46_1[2] = L48_1
L47_1 = {}
L48_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_ACT1_INTERLUDE4"
L49_1 = [[
Hard work does not guarantee results.
The process does not represent the outcome.
Even so, one cannot ignore the words, "hard work."]]
L47_1[1] = L48_1
L47_1[2] = L49_1
L48_1 = {}
L49_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_ACT1_INTERLUDE5"
L50_1 = [[
Even though neither my voice nor heart can reach you,
I know that we share the warmth of our clasped hands.]]
L48_1[1] = L49_1
L48_1[2] = L50_1
L49_1 = {}
L50_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_ACT1_EPILOGUE"
L51_1 = [[
Seasons may change,
but my feelings for you will last forever.]]
L49_1[1] = L50_1
L49_1[2] = L51_1
L50_1 = {}
L51_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_MEMORIAL_ACT2_PROLOGUE"
L52_1 = [[
Swords rust when neglected.
People are like swords in that sense.]]
L50_1[1] = L51_1
L50_1[2] = L52_1
