L34_1 = [[
The establishment of Prydwen Institution dates back to the era of the British Empire.
The empire on which the sun never sets absorbed massive resources and culture through its colonies around the world.
Of course, some of them included relics of Counterside.]]
L32_1[1] = L33_1
