L2_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_VARUNA_INTERLUDE13"
L3_1 = [[
I have made a vow to myself.
That I will find every single member of the Society responsible for causing the Great Gyre and kill them all.
That single thought is the sole motivator that has led me this far, and...
it will also be my last revenge for my son and wife... whose faces I can't even remember now.]]
