L11_1 = "「We are in the same boat.」 The compound eyes bent into the shape of a crescent moon with joy.\nFor the child was too right-minded, it knew she would do anything for her beliefs.\nSo, it reached out its hand. For a droplet of black is enough to taint a blank canvas."
